{"unit_id":"tag:0CFX:proof","translation":"这可以用与引理<REF_0001>完全相同的方法证明。\n也可以利用拓扑空间（topological spaces）的映射（map）是同胚（homeomorphism）当且仅当它是单射（injective）、满射（surjective）且开的（open）这一事实。\n因此，万有同胚（universal homeomorphism）就是满射（surjective）、万有地单射（injective）且万有开的（universally open）态射（morphism）。\n见《空间的态射（Morphisms）》，引理<REF_0002>以及《空间的态射（Morphisms）》，定义<REF_0003>、<REF_0004>、<REF_0005>、<REF_0006>。\n因此，此引理由引理<REF_0007>、<REF_0008>和<REF_0009>得到。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"homeomorphism","target_term":"同胚"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开的"},{"source_term":"universal homeomorphism","target_term":"万有同胚"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"universally open","target_term":"万有开的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"homeomorphism","target_term":"同胚","context":"拓扑同胚，待决。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"映射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"映射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开的","context":"映射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"universal homeomorphism","target_term":"万有同胚","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"universally open","target_term":"万有开的","context":"态射性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"章节名称，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
